      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that there are two sides, but doesnt the \"catastrophic\" part of the climate argument basically make the economic side a moot point? like, if the planet is unlivable, what does economic stability even matter? it feels like the choice is pretty obvious if you actually look at the long-term math.",
